  "description": "One-time-code entry. Renders length real cells in its own shadow root (it owns the inputs, so every cell carries full ARIA), routes all entry — typing, paste, SMS autofill — through one sanitizing pipeline, and participates in forms via ElementInternals with the full constraint-validation API. No hidden input, no wrapper md-text-field.",
